{"created": "2025-05-14T11:22:35.525330+00:00", "modified": "2025-05-14T11:22:36.256308+00:00", "id": 15407814, "conceptrecid": "15407813", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15407814", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.15407813", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.15407814", "metadata": {"title": "Experimental Data on the Hyperelastic and Viscoelastic Properties of Human Female Perineal Tissue", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15407814", "publication_date": "2025-05-14", "description": "<p>The dataset contains raw data from stress-relaxation and ultimate tensile tests performed on<em>&nbsp;post-mortem&nbsp;</em>human female perineal tissue using a Zwick/Roell biaxial testing machine operated in uniaxial mode.</p>\n<p>The following variables are included:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time &ndash; Duration of the experiment (in seconds).</li>\n<li>Displacement X &ndash; Combined displacement of the two axes in the x-direction.</li>\n<li>Displacement Y &ndash; Combined displacement of the two axes in the y-direction.</li>\n<li>Force X &ndash; Combined force from the two axes in the x-direction.</li>\n<li>Force Y &ndash; Combined force from the two axes in the y-direction.</li>\n<li>Absolute Position Axis 1 - 4 &ndash; Position of each axis (1 to 4), measured from the pre-defined machine setup.</li>\n<li>Absolute Displacement X &ndash; Combined displacement in the x-direction, calculated using the absolute positions of the relevant axes.</li>\n<li>Absolute Displacement Y &ndash; Combined displacement in the y-direction, calculated using the absolute positions of the relevant axes.</li>\n<li>Force 1 - 4 &ndash; Force measured individually on axes 1 to 4.</li>\n<li>Relative Position Axis 1 - 4 &ndash; Position of each axis (1 to 4), with the starting position at 0 mm.</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "restricted", "creators": [{"name": "Author", "affiliation": null}], "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last"